CRUD must use
=======================

Security		Function
---------------------------------------------------------
CSRF Protection:	wp_nonce_field()
Verify Form:	wp_verify_nonce()
Input Clean:	sanitize_text_field()
Output Safe:	esc_html()
Safe output: 	esc_attr()
Email Clean:	sanitize_email()
Prevent accidental delete:    confirm()
ID sanitization: 	intval()
url security : 	esc_url()
SQL safety:	$wpdb->prepare()


